      "text": "[9:20AM] #Apogbon\n#EkoBridge\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nInward Apongbon underneath the bridge is still good to go, \nMoving  towards UBA roundabout enroute inner marina still on a good side.\nLikewise  inward Leventis, Elegbata and Ebute Ero to connect Eko bridge.\n\nBroad street inward Apongbon underneath the bridge enroute Offin Canal is equally good, descending CMS bridge inw Offin Canal presently is good to go.\n\nMen of  CRCC construction are doing palliative work ascending Apongbon bridge inward CMS proper, the activities have streamlined motorists descending from Eko bridge to a single  lane.\n#FollowLASTMA\n@trafficpalava \n@TrafficChiefNG \n@lagostraffic961",
